 is my posting on preownedweddingdresses.com or feel free to contact me directly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/153204&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/153204&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.katiemay.com\/products\/lanai-gown&#039;&gt;Katie May Lanai gown&lt;\/a&gt;. I paid $1,800 total for it and I&#039;m selling for $1,100. The only alterations I made was having it hemmed (I&#039;m 5&#039;5\" and had it hemmed for 2\" heels) and putting in the bustle - so it could easily be taken in or out for it&#039;s next owner if needed. Payment through PayPal and I can cover shipping costs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(More pictures at the links above.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy to answer any questions!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":33833,"Name":"9.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-278581-0-79461100-1442689077.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-278581-0-79461100-1442689077_thumb.jpg","Width":799,"Height":1200},{"Id":33834,"Name":"7.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-278581-0-84282600-1442689253.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-278581-0-84282600-1442689253_thumb.jpg","Width":799,"Height":1200}],"Id":1905056,"PostDate":1442692884,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone - I am selling my once-worn but like-new wedding dress. Here is my posting on preownedweddingdresses.com or feel free to contact me directly.\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/153204' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.preowned...ses\/view\/153204<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is the <a href='http:\/\/www.katiemay.com\/products\/lanai-gown' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Katie May Lanai gown<\/a>. I paid $1,800 total for it and I'm selling for $1,100. The only alterations I made was having it hemmed (I'm 5'5\" and had it hemmed for 2\" heels) and putting in the bustle - so it could easily be taken in or out for it's next owner if needed. Payment through PayPal and I can cover shipping costs.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>(More pictures at the links above.)\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy to answer any questions!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403119687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.12.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79602,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55df3d8431c76f00d6e824890d0580a5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What a beautiful dress!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905065,"PostDate":1442711658,"Pos