{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.150.95.42","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"587578e7c1c1c22960f58c604790c0e9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You are getting a lot done @[member=\"RandL2015\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Since I&#039;m so short, the designer custom made my dress to fit my height but when I had my first fitting I discovered they had cut it too short and they have to remake the skirt which won&#039;t be finished until October and the wedding is in November :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903932,"PostDate":1441118888,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You are getting a lot done @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271841\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271841-randl2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RandL2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Since I'm so short, the designer custom made my dress to fit my height but when I had my first fitting I discovered they had cut it too short and they have to remake the skirt which won't be finished until October and the wedding is in November <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397425622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.194.118.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"085dabc6c6e07bdd781ae89bae0c79f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh No @[member=\"malyna\"]!! &amp;nbsp;I know that is stressful. I&#039;m sure everything will be okay. &amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp;It&#039;s a good thing you didn&#039;t wait until the very last minute. One of my friends was still getting her dress altered 2 days before her wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903952,"PostDate":1441125793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh No @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277580-malyna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">malyna<\/span><\/a>!! \u00a0I know that is stressful. I'm sure everything will be okay. \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0It's a good thing you didn't wait until the very last minute. One of my friends was still getting her dress altered 2 days before her wedding.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.200.253.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ca5c3ab806e358c0228ca4c7577c627","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"RandL2015\"] - love everything!!&amp;nbsp; Seems like you have everything under control!!&amp;nbsp; I really need to get organized.&amp;nbsp; That&#039;s this week&#039;s to do - create 1 massive to do list and assign due dates - I do better with structure lol.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where did you get the monogramed tote bags and backpacks and the robes?  &amp;nbsp;I may have to steal some of these ideas!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"malyna\"] - that does suck!&amp;nbsp; But like @[member=\"RandL2015\"] said good thing you caught it early!&amp;nbsp; My dress hasn&#039;t come in yet.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s scheduled to be here 9\/20.&amp;nbsp; Fingers crossed we&#039;re on time.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903956,"PostDate":1441128615,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271841\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271841-randl2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RandL2015<\/span><\/a> - love everything!!\u00a0 Seems like you have everything under control!!\u00a0 I really need to get organized.\u00a0 That's this week's to do - create 1 massive to do list and assign due dates - I do better with structure lol.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where did you get the monogramed tote bags and backpacks and the robes?\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0I may have to steal some of these ideas!!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277580-malyna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">malyna<\/span><\/a> - that does suck!\u00a0 But like @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271841\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271841-randl2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RandL2015<\/span><\/a> said good thing you caught it early!\u00a0 My dress hasn't come in yet.\u00a0 It's scheduled to be here 9\/20.\u00a0 Fingers crossed we're on time.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Daisy<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to marry my best friend \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79500-janjins-planning-thread-azul-sensatori\/?p=1902797'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79500-janjins-planning-thread-azul-sensatori\/?p=1902797<\/a>","Email":"daisy.pitre@gmail.com","IpAddress":"142.255.87.125","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414946723,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Janjin","Id":280967,"Name":"Janjin","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.229.104.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b0ea517e23ebf6fa4ef3cee6232c2076","RawContent":"Yeah I&#039;m in the middle of looking for shoes now\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1903966,"PostDate":1441143070,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yeah I'm in the middle of looking for shoes now<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397425622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.75.116.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c298905a9cef8d3d4ca8fa80d6d5813a","RawContent":"@Jangin purchased the tote bags from the knot, their wedding shop. They had a sale where they were $9.95 + $4.95 for monograming.  The robes I ordered from DH Gate for $14 each.\n\n\n@[member=\"malyna\"] I am just wearing wedge flip flops. Beachy and comfortable.\n\n\nWill try to get more items done this weekend. \ud83d\ude00","Attachments":[],"Id":1903971,"PostDate":1441150791,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @Jangin purchased the tote bags from the knot, their wedding shop. They had a sale where they were $9.95 + $4.95 for monograming.  The robes I ordered from DH Gate for $14 each.<br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277580-malyna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">malyna<\/span><\/a> I am just wearing wedge flip flops. Beachy and comfortable.<br><br>\nWill try to get more items done this weekend. \ud83d\ude00\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.143.121.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf773444b43242c526216911c9b822a4","RawContent":"Ok fellow November 2015 Brides, we have 1 full month of planning, what is everyone doing now?\n\n\nI just had my bridal shower this past Saturday, which was so much fun. Gave out my \"Bridal Entourage \" gift bags which they loved. \n\nPacked 2 suitcases with all of my reception, and party decorations.\n\n\nSubmitted my documents to the resort, and finalized my wedding contract.\n\n\nNow, that I have a final count of 23 guests that will be joining us, I am going to get my OOT bags together.\n\n\nWhew, I feel like it is all coming together.\n","Attachments":[],"Id":1905916,"PostDate":1444014484,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok fellow November 2015 Brides, we have 1 full month of planning, what is everyone doing now?<br><br>\nI just had my bridal shower this past Saturday, which was so much fun. Gave out my \"Bridal Entourage \" gift bags which they loved. <br>\nPacked 2 suitcases with all of my reception, and party decorations.<br><br>\nSubmitted my documents to the resort, and finalized my wedding contract.<br><br>\nNow, that I have a final count of 23 guests that will be joining us, I am going to get my OOT bags together.<br><br>\nWhew, I feel like it is all coming together.<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905916]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-40867800-1444028649.jpeg\" title=\"image.jpeg -  131.13KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-40867800-1444028649.jpeg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpeg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905916]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-27365900-1444028755.jpeg\" title=\"image.jpeg -  110.33KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-27365900-1444028755.jpeg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpeg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905916]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-14895300-1444028772.jpeg\" title=\"image.jpeg -  69.1KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-14895300-1444028772.jpeg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpeg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":46,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
